.wrangler/
scripts/.metadata-backups/
__pycache__/
.claude/settings.local.json
data/*.backup*.json
data/*.draft.json

# Cloudflare/local secrets. `.dev.vars` is what `wrangler dev` reads for the
# site and wav-download Workers; `.env` is the general equivalent. Both hold
# live API tokens, so they are ignored by wildcard and the *.example templates
# are re-included explicitly — a narrower rule would miss `.dev.vars.staging`
# and similar. Salvaged from PR #1 (the auto-generated Cloudflare Workers
# config PR, otherwise closed as superseded); this half was the only part of it
# worth keeping.
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example
